# 四、Controller 层测试

## 4.1 MockMvc 测试

```java
@SpringBootTest
@AutoConfigureMockMvc
@DisplayName("文章接口测试")
class ArticleControllerTest {

    @Autowired
    private MockMvc mockMvc;

    @MockBean  // 替换真实的 Service
    private ArticleService articleService;

    @Test
    @DisplayName("获取文章列表 - 返回200")
    void should_return_200_when_get_articles() throws Exception {
        // Given
        PageResult<ArticleVO> pageResult = PageResult.of(
                List.of(new ArticleVO(1L, "Test", "...")),
                100L, 1, 10
        );
        when(articleService.getArticles(anyInt(), anyInt(), any(), any()))
                .thenReturn(pageResult);

        // When & Then
        mockMvc.perform(get("/articles")
                        .param("page", "1")
                        .param("size", "10"))
                .andExpect(status().isOk())
                .andExpect(jsonPath("$.code").value(200))
                .andExpect(jsonPath("$.data.records.length()").value(1));
    }

    @Test
    @DisplayName("创建文章 - 未登录返回401")
    void should_return_401_when_no_token() throws Exception {
        mockMvc.perform(post("/articles")
                        .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)
                        .content("{\"title\":\"test\"}"))
                .andExpect(status().isUnauthorized());
    }
}
```

